ct","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her maiden name is Igarashi Asami. She and the protagonist Ryousuke dated from high school until college, and they both had their first time with each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, their mutual friend Nagai Kouji pushed down Asami and had sex with her, which caused her breakup with Ryousuke. She married Kouji soon after."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouji was deceived by a friend, which left him with a huge debt. To help her husband, Asami accepted Ubai's job offer where she and Ryousuke met once again."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29436"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓、五十嵐 麻美。高校から大学まで亮介とつき合っていた女性で、互いに初めての相手でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、ある日2人の共通の友人である永井浩二に押し倒されてしまい、それが原因で亮介と別れ、浩二と結婚した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"浩二が友人に騙され借金を背負ったため、何とか力になりたいと『奪』のスカウトを受け、そこで偶然亮介と再会した。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20227","sourceWorkId":"20792","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓五十岚，25岁的家庭主妇。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她与主人公亮介从高中到大学一直交往，两人还共同体验了初夜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一日，他们共同的朋友永井浩二推倒了麻美并与其发生关系，导致麻美与亮介分手。不久后，麻美便嫁给了浩二。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"浩二为朋友背负了巨额债务。为了帮助丈夫，麻美接受了“夺”的工作邀请。对于与亮介忽然重逢感到不安。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195876"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"25 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20227","sourceWorkId":"20792","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a16ed123fdf8d37555ff2ee877c6a36f5e6d9b24ae909ff4ea58bbeb08a590ee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88e74b9d3013e1aa9a475606dd8f4f87af67b80d8a12d25d1f19cda751e081b5.webp","width":164,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ももぞの 薫","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59811","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29437","characterName":"宇津木 椿姫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195877","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271249"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20228"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29437"},"originalCharacterName":"宇津木 椿姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her maiden name is Kamizono Tsubaki. She and her little sister Mizuki lost their parents early, and while facing hardships living in their relative's house, she looked after Mizuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After her arranged marriage, she has a smooth sailing life. She and her husband Kiyoshi has been married for 5 years, and has a 4 year old son named Seiichi. Mizuki also lives with them, which makes them a family of 4."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsubaki is a very modest housewife, nevertheless, she decided to work at Ubai after her husband got tricked into an investment scam which left them with a huge debt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29437"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓、神園 椿姫。早くに両親を亡くし、親戚の家で苦労しながら妹の翠姫の面倒を見ていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見合い結婚をしてからは順風満帆な生活を送ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫の清と結婚して5年、4歳になる息子の清一がおり、翠姫をあわせた4人で生活している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貞淑な人妻だが、夫が投資詐欺に騙され多額の借金を抱えてしまい、『奪』を頼ることに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20228","sourceWorkId":"20792","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓神园。和妹妹翠姬早年丧双亲，寄居在亲戚家时历经艰辛，她始终照顾着翠姬。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"婚后生活本是一帆风顺。与丈夫结婚五年，育有一名四岁儿子。翠姬也与他们同住，一家四口其乐融融。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是一位非常谦逊的家庭主妇，然而，在丈夫被诱骗参与一场投资诈骗后负债累累，她决定前往“夺”工作。宁愿剑走偏锋也要维持自己家庭的和睦状态。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195877"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"29 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20228","sourceWorkId":"20792","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfc25692b9137b4422bdd1985f54d99385d5997b2ef54c70ae63cbd7079f33a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b41cbf581cd77ee464b51ec111a30fe711ef5d062dc1e59b52989f82b39909bc.webp","width":114,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"綾瀬 あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s601","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s601","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s601","name":"松平 美波穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59814","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29438","characterName":"神園 翠姫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195878","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271249"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20229"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29438"},"originalCharacterName":"神園 翠姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The little sister of Tsubaki. She has always watched her older sister deal with hardships for her so she thinks of ways to repay her someday."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Recently, she started dating her coworker Fujiki Kei, but their relationship remains pure, and so she's still a virgin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seeing her sister act strangely, she tailed her and discovered that she's working at \"Ubai\", and with this turn of events, she decided sell her body as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29438"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"椿姫の妹。年の離れた姉が苦労して自分を守ってくれる姿を見続けていて、いつかその恩を返そうとずっと考えていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、アルバイト先の同僚である藤木圭とつき合いだしたが、まだ清い交際であり処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の様子がおかしいのを見抜いて後をつけ、姉が『奪』で働いていることを知り、自分も体を売ることを決意する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20229","sourceWorkId":"20792","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"椿姫的妹妹。总是看着姐姐为她排忧解难，所以一直想办法如何报答。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近，她开始和同事约会，但他们的关系仍然很纯洁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看到姐姐行为怪异，她尾随其后，发现了姐姐在“夺”工作的秘密，随着事态的发展，她决定也出卖自己的身体。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195878"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"19 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20229","sourceWorkId":"20792","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/baf0fcffb92a06c274c2f63cab36d0bb196756e0ec0bc2f3dcdf56ff91464ea7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4a85c94416133a9598617e69effc6a944a5fe68866905bb4d95c71634e21160.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"黒沢 まき","creatorId":"vndb:s3367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3367","name":"黒沢まき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59813","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65073","characterName":"飯島 亮介","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195883","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271250"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6182"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65073"},"originalCharacterName":"飯島 亮介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"25 years old (Ubai)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"26 years old (Ubai Again)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"27 years old (Ubai Ending)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wishes to be a cameraman, so he got employed at a video production company, but due to a scandal involving a woman, the said company went bankrupt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The scandal was widely known, so he was having a hard time getting reemployed. It was at the time that Ubai picked him up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he was a newbie, he did miscellaneous jobs, and sometimes even worked as an AV actor. He was also like an assistant director."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a fetish for \"women's adultery\", and so he gets excited with both \"netori\" and \"netorare\". He is Asami's ex-boyfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65073"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「奪」の男優兼カメラマン兼ＡＤ。女の裏切りに興奮する性癖があり、そのため寝取り、寝取られどちらもいける。いっそ自分が当事者でなくてもいいという、ちょっと困った部分も。このために「奪」の裏の仕事に惹かれ、離れられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"半年前の仕事を経て、より「奪」の深みに足を踏み入れようと決意。自ら積極的に女を堕とすことに挑戦する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6182","sourceWorkId":"21645","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻美的前男友。他由于当摄影师的梦想，而在一家视频制作公司工作。但由于涉及一名女性的丑闻，公司破产。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在他难以重新就业的时候，“夺”接受了他。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为新手，他做过各种各样的工作，不仅兼职助理导演，有时甚至当AV演员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他对看人妻出轨有特殊癖好，对“netori”和“netorare”都很兴奋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195883"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5482c428d1ee9ce228027bbcc832183e77ec8c8191c292be9650949922600ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0dfaca82aa6b4bc23442d725b4e5b98be44dce79bd63738403a3202db9fc8b0.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c150264","characterName":"永井 浩二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c150264"},"originalCharacterName":"永井 浩二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mutual friend who used to hang out with Ryosuke and Asami. He is now Asami's husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a good man, though thoughtless, but that is how he ended up taking on his friend's debts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He runs around every day trying to raise money, and lately he has become very tired."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150264"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c150265","characterName":"宇津木 清","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c150265"},"originalCharacterName":"宇津木 清","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A picture-perfect, kind husband. He works for a major trading company. he is indifferent to sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is good at his job and has recently become more and more fulfilled as he competes for promotion within the company."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150265"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29439","characterName":"露口 愛海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29439"},"originalCharacterName":"露口 愛海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A manager at Ubai who handles the makeup of actresses, lighting, and sometimes camera work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also works as a model and has nude pictures of her taken, but without showing her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her work in the other Ubai includes scouting, client relations, and investigation. For some reason, she can sniff out women who can potentially work at Ubai, or people who might be interested in becoming members. She was also the one who found Ryousuke and recruited him to work under her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She looks at society with mocking eyes, and is a sarcastic person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Ubai Again, she incited Ryousuke, and will decide whether he has what it takes to follow through Gen's footsteps."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Manami is a child born from the adultery of her mother with Gen. She uses this info as blackmail to have sex with Gen whenever she wants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/8139ad850a60762f818135bfb0781b0ddb67926e43774b0e2b8eda39bdf9446a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90543a5a8ffbdbef7f54ba4482967285c759719ff4021e448baae0cfd8cd7266.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"陽茉莉","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59812","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65190",